<Base title="about · poshitha">
  <h1 class="page-title">more about me</h1>
  <p class="lede">the person, not the resume.</p>

  <p>
    i grew up in tirupati, a small temple town in the south of india.
    then boarding school in jaipur — it's a palace, literally — then
    lehigh for cs + finance with a math minor, and now san francisco.
    every place rewired me a little.
  </p>
  <p>
    off the clock i collect things: restaurants worth a detour, films
    from countries i've never been to, film photos of places i have.
  </p>

  <ul class="trail">
    <li><a href="/food">food</a> <span class="muted">— places i'd send you, on a map</span></li>
    <li><a href="/movies">movies</a> <span class="muted">— the quest to watch a film from every country</span></li>
    <li><a href="/photos">photos</a> <span class="muted">— from everywhere i've been</span></li>
  </ul>

  <style>
    p { max-width: 56ch; margin: 0 0 18px; }
